            },
            "word_end": 12,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "«إِذَا صَلَّيْتَ فَصَلِّ فِي نَعْلَيْكَ إِذَا كَانَتْ طَاهِرَةً فَإِنَّ ذَلِكَ مِنَ السُّنَّةِ».",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "“When you perform salat (prayer), then perform salat (prayer) in your sandals if they are taharah (ritually pure), for indeed that is from the sunnah (prophetic tradition).”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 24,
